adaptation = "The source ranks CSI 300 constituents weekly, then applies a 100-day price filter, a two-day gap filter, a 200-day index regime filter, and ATR-based position sizing. The implementation exposes only the source's transparent 90-day continuous score across the current daily stock universe. JoinQuant's attribute_history price adjustment is not pinned, so the project uses qfq."
